<b><span class="legacy-b902eeb30e">Schutzenfest 2015</span></b>
<br> &nbsp;The Annual Schutzenfest and Oktoberfest was celebrated in coordination with the Concordia Club and the Pine Tree Rifle Club on Saturday, September 19. Schutzenfest directors,
<br>Clif Wassel and Mark Wendt both agreed that the event was very successful and weather truly cooperated. Mark Duesler captured the championship followed in second place by Harold Miller,
<br>and third place, John Quackenbush. The Schutzenfest was hosted at the Pine Tree Rifle Club and is one of many special shoots that are open to the public.
<br>Competitor Photo (l to r): Ken Benton, Chris Bouck, Mark Wendt, John Quackenbush, Wayne VanDetta, Harold Miller, Garry Sprung, Mark Duesler,
<br>Peter Betz, Clif Wassel, and Doug Sterling. Photo coutesty (Peter Betz).
